  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agri-Enterprise in Sunflower, Soya bean, SIm sim and Sorgham for Small Scale Far</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project works to enable communities in Northern Uganda to establish small scale sustainable commercial farming operations generating incomes for families supporting orphans. The project will establish 3 new Farmer Co-operatives, supported by agricultural, business, financial &amp; land-rights awareness training. It also work with whole communities to empower women to achieve equal rights and voice through training &#x2018;Community Land Advocacy agents&#x2019; who improve understanding and respect for land rights, with a focus on wider gender and community relations. Previous projects have demonstrated this approach to be successful.</narrative>
  </description>
